KNOBS
 -convergence_tolerance 1e-12
TITLE Pyrite Oxidation Equilibrium
SOLUTION 1 Pure Water
    temp      25
    pH        7.0
    pe        4.0
    units     mmol/kgw
    water     1 # kg

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Pyrite    0.0  0.1    # Dissolve up to 0.1 moles of Pyrite
    O2(g)     -0.7 10.0   # Maintain atmospheric oxygen contact (log P = -0.7)
    Goethite  0.0  0.0    # Allow secondary iron minerals to precipitate
    Gypsum    0.0  0.0    # Allow gypsum to form if Ca is present (not in this simple case)

SELECTED_OUTPUT
